alias [global] state | enable | disable | bold
alias [global] show <name> <event> [bold]
alias [global] add <name> <event> <attrs>/<attrs> <conds>/<conds> <clause><clause> <flags>/<flags> <type> <func> [body]
alias [global] add <name> macro <command> [body]
alias [global] access <name> <level>
alias [global] del <name> <event>

Events: message, /me, subject, join, leave, ban, kick, nick, role, status, macro

macro help <command> [text]   - set/show help text for a macro
macro taboo [command]          - toggle a macro off for this chat

